<title>GERMANY: Buba revises German Sept industry orders up.</title>
<headline>Buba revises German Sept industry orders up.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following revised index figures:</p>
<p> PAN-GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS     Sept 96	   Aug 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 -3.4	     +0.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   -1.1	     +4.0</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    95.9 (95.7)    99.3</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 -3.6	     +0.2</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   -1.6	     +4.5</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    94.4	     97.9</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 -2.0	     -3.6</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +5.3	     -5.4</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		   130.5 (129.8)  133.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are seasonally adjusted. The percentage change figures are calculated by Reuters from the indices.</p>
<p>Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
